# Solar PV Calculator - Advanced Features Implementation

## Overview
Implement all missing features to transform the basic calculator into a professional-grade solar PV analysis tool.

## Tasks

### [/] Phase 1: Quick Wins (High Impact, Low Effort)
- [/] Add charts to Word export (canvas to image)
- [ ] CSV data export functionality
- [ ] Parameter presets (Residential, Commercial, Utility)
- [ ] Multiple scenario comparison
- [ ] Save/load project data

### [ ] Phase 2: Real Data Integration
- [ ] PVGIS API integration for real climate data
- [ ] Module database (top manufacturers)
